cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AegisTune, cite this repository and the exact release or commit."
title: "AegisTune: Auditable billing agents"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "AegisTune contributors"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A synthetic bilingual billing-agent environment, supervised LoRA adaptation,
  independent outcome auditing, and recorded paired evidence for Tiny Aya Global.
  The reserved evaluation compares a fixed base model and SFT v3 adapter on 200
  cases per arm; the separate AgentTune GRPO pilot is an instrumental result.
